      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Land tax rice in the vermilion set = 5,135.8162 koku. The large opening bracket above 正 begins the parenthesis that wraps the whole seven-line vermilion block; its closing bracket falls on the facing page, where upper_p061_right opens with 通リ）. Per the prose note in the two columns that follow, this is the plain 1864-68 average, which includes the 1866 crop failure, and it therefore sits 649.83 koku below the main-text figure of 5,785.64165."
      },
