  {
    "id": "anno-toyooka_upper_p060_left-13",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "是ハ甲子ヨリ戊辰マテ五ヶ年平均然ルニ右平均中丙寅年ハ非常ノ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "これは甲子（1864）より戊辰（1868）まで五ヶ年の平均なり。然るに右の平均中、丙寅年（1866）は非常の"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "First line of the explanatory note: 'These are the five-year average from the kinoe-ne year (1864) through the tsuchinoe-tatsu year (1868). However, within that average the hinoe-tora year (1866) was an extraordinary —' (continues in the next column)."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "凶年注記前行"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p060_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:1160,1340,107,2423"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-toyooka_upper_p060_left-14",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "凶作ニ而此凶年ヲ除キ癸亥ヨリ數ヘ戊辰マテ平常ノ平均額本文ノ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "凶作にて、この凶年を除き、癸亥（1863）より数えて戊辰（1868）まで、平常の平均額は本文の…"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Second line of the note: '— crop failure, so excluding that famine year and counting from the mizunoto-i year (1863) through the tsuchinoe-tatsu year (1868), the normal average amount is as in the main text …'. The sentence breaks off here and runs onto the facing page, where upper_p061_right opens with 通リ）, completing it. This is what distinguishes the two sets of figures on the page: the main-text set excludes 1866, the vermilion set does not."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "凶年注記後行"
      }
    ],
